# Agent Configuration

This file defines the AI agents and their capabilities for {{PROJECT_NAME}}.

## Agent Types

### Code Agent
- **Purpose**: Code generation and modification
- **Tools**: Read, Write, Edit, Bash
- **Model**: Claude 5 Sonnet

### Review Agent
- **Purpose**: Code review and quality checks
- **Tools**: Read, Grep, Glob
- **Model**: Claude 5 Opus

### Test Agent
- **Purpose**: Test generation and execution
- **Tools**: Bash, test frameworks
- **Model**: Claude 5 Haiku

## Agent Configuration

```yaml
agents:
  code:
    model: claude-5-sonnet
    temperature: 0.7
    max_tokens: 4096

  review:
    model: claude-5-opus
    temperature: 0.3
    max_tokens: 2048

  test:
    model: claude-5-haiku
    temperature: 0.5
    max_tokens: 1024
```

## Usage

Agents are automatically selected based on the task type:

```bash
# Code generation
claude code generate --agent code

# Code review
claude code review --agent review

# Test generation
claude code test --agent test
```

